# The Stalker's Hollow - an island of the library's plan The Sunken Kingdom (sunken 40 m; chapter 9, the deep - finale 2)
# A cavern under the trench lip: a round arena floor ringed by rock, four stone alcoves round it that still hold air,
# the Network's last lamps on posts, and in the middle a seal valve on a stone plinth. Across the arena the Network gate
# under the Ringwave - shut. The Abyssal Stalker hunts here: a huge dark angler (size 3), two phases, calling smaller
# anglers when hurt. What the Spire's choice did shows at the valve: RESTORE lights the alcoves teal and opens the gate;
# SEAL drops a stone plug over it. Quest "The Deep" (23 steps).
#
# Points (metres over the arena floor; the surface at 40): the arena at 0, r 16 round 0 0; the lip (a terrace) at 8
# round -22 0 with the warden's post and the chain up to the buoy (an air deck at 24); the alcoves (3 x 3 m, doors to
# the arena): 1 north round 0 13.5, 2 east 13.5 0, 3 south 0 -13.5, 4 west -12.5 7; the plinth at 0 0; the gate at
# 15 13 (north-east), facing the arena.
include lib_features
include lib_sea
include lib_gravity
include lib_sunken
# RESIZE 10-24: Radius 40 -> 95 (Height 10 -> 10), the island grows round the old content, which stays where it was.
new
gen Trees=0 Bushes=0 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0 BeachThings=0
gen Seed=11001 Radius=110 Height=10 Roughness=0.5 Peaks=3 Shape=0 Style=0 BeachWidth=0.1 Cliffs=0.6 PeakShape=0.5
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.6 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.3 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0.2
generate
elevation -40

