note dnote Ines's last slate | DIVE SLATE - I. MARLOWE\n\nTo whoever has Mo.\nI followed you down the chain as far as the lip. Further than this, the Stalker would hear me, and you have enough to carry.\nFennick and Halvard went to the vent. Neither of them came back up the chain. I sat here a long time with my light off.\nGo and finish it. Then go up, find a boy on a high island with a warden's hat over his eyes, and give him his whale. Tell him his mum is coming. Tell him she counted everybody.
note dcamp Diver's cache | A diver's spare kit, wired shut against the current.
